config BR2_PACKAGE_TOON_HUB
	bool "toon-hub"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_MOSQUITTO
	select BR2_PACKAGE_MOSQUITTO_BROKER
	select BR2_PACKAGE_TOON_BUS
	help
	  toon-sensord: room temperature (two-sensor estimate),
	  humidity and light as retoon/climate on the Toon's own
	  MQTT broker.

	  toon-mqttd: publishes the sensors, the boiler values and the
	  thermostat to Home Assistant over MQTT with discovery. The
	  broker settings are read from
	  /mnt/data/toon-os/config/mqtt.conf, which is not in the image.
	  It reads the other programs' states from the Toon's own
	  broker (S41toon-broker, mosquitto on 127.0.0.1, which starts
	  itself again when it stops) and sends Home Assistant's
	  commands there.
